  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards a Self-reliant Church in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To recognise the many forms that self-reliance can take
2. To develop and deepen a mature spirituality committed to finding ways of sustaining an evangelising and dynamic church
3. To bring together representatives from national CCJPs across the Southern Africa region in order to share challenges and experiences, and identify new ways of working together.
4. For CCJP representatives to be better equipped to promote Catholic social teaching in their countries.</narrative>
  </description>
